001300*                      FOR ANSI COBOL CB545 V2 LVL78 ANSI or
001400*                          similar.
001500*
001600*                  PARM cc1 = R = Resequenced deck by 10 or
001700*                             C = Reseq of 100 or
001710*                               space for none)
001800*                       cc2-9 Program name 8 chars so if both
001900*                             code PARM='RCOBXREF' or 'CCOBXREF'.
