041400*
041500 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING EXEC-PARAMETER.
041600 BEGINRUN.
041700     MOVE     PROG-NAME TO H1PROG-NAME.
041800     MOVE     CURRENT-DATE TO HDDATE.
041900     IF       HDDATE NOT = '000000'
042000              MOVE HD-Y TO HD2-Y
042100              MOVE HD-M TO HD2-M
042200              MOVE HD-D TO HD2-D
042300              MOVE HDDATEB TO H1DATE.
042400     MOVE     TIME-OF-DAY TO HDTIME.
042500     PERFORM  OPEN-SOURCE-FILE THRU READ-EXIT.
042600     OPEN     OUTPUT SUPPLEMENTAL-PART1-OUT SOURCE-LISTING.
042700*
042800 READLOOP1.
042900     PERFORM  READ-A-SOURCE-RECORD THRU READ-EXIT.
043000     PERFORM  INC-COBOLREFNO.
043100     PERFORM  OUTPUTSOURCE.
043200     IF       SV1PROGRAM-ID
043300              NOT = 'PROGRAM-ID.'
043400              GO TO READLOOP1.
043500*>     DISPLAY  'Pass 1/5'.
043600     MOVE     ZEROS TO WBUCKET.
043700     MOVE     SPACES TO SV3DPROG SV1PROGRAM-ID.
043800*
043900 EXAMINELOOP1.
044000     IF       SV1WHAT = 'DATA DIVISION.  '
044100              MOVE 'COBL' TO HOLDID1
044200*              DISPLAY  'PASS 2'
044300              GO TO READLOOP3.
044400     MOVE     ZERO TO TALLY.
044500     EXAMINE  SV3PROGRAMID TALLYING LEADING SPACES.
044600     MOVE     TALLY TO Q.
044700     IF       Q > 58
044800              PERFORM READ-A-SOURCE-RECORD THRU READ-EXIT
044900              PERFORM INC-COBOLREFNO
045000              PERFORM OUTPUTSOURCE
045100              GO TO EXAMINELOOP1.
045200*
045300 EXAMINELOOP2.
045400     ADD      1 TO WBUCKET.
045500     ADD      1 TO Q.
045600     IF       SV3-12 (Q) = '.'
045700              GO TO EXAMINELOOP3.
045800     MOVE     SV3-12 (Q) TO SV3-1 (WBUCKET).
045900     IF       WBUCKET NOT > 10
046000              GO TO EXAMINELOOP2.
046100*
046200 EXAMINELOOP3.
046300     MOVE     ZEROS TO WBUCKET.
046400     MOVE     SV3DPROG TO HOLDID H1PROGRAMID.
046500     GO       TO READLOOP2.
046600*
046700 INC-COBOLREFNO.
046800     IF       SEQUENCE-100
046900              ADD 100 TO COBOLREFNO
047000     ELSE
047100              ADD  10 TO COBOLREFNO.
047200     ADD      1 TO GEN-REFNO1.
047300     ADD      1 TO GEN-REFNO2.
047400*
047500 READLOOP2.
047600     PERFORM  READ-A-SOURCE-RECORD THRU READ-EXIT.
